ated the issuance of the Class A ordinary shares.","context":"On December 28, 2023, the Company completed the acquisition of 100% of the issued and outstanding shares of Alpha Mind, at a total consideration of $180,000 (“Acquisition”). The purchase price is payable in the form of promissory note (collectively, the “Notes” and each, a “Note”). The Notes have a maturity of 90 days from the closing date, an interest rate at an annual rate to 3% per annum and will be secured by all of the issued and outstanding equity of Alpha Mind and all of the assets of Alpha Mind, including its consolidated entities. On December 28, 2023, the Company issued Notes of $153,000 and $27,000, respectively, to MMTEC, Inc. and Burgeon Capital, Inc (collectively “Sellers of Alpha Mind”).","section":"Results of Operations","block":146,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-078731","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-16","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001769256","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769256/000121390026078731/ea0296080-6k_xchange.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/9846771389d4dc09595cbc77276b3e5be5a9694c952c131163f3e51ecdb6845e.bin","sha256":"9846771389d4dc09595cbc77276b3e5be5a9694c952c131163f3e51ecdb6845e"}},{"id":"b3f41f0e2037ba8870c05b74094015e49e77fe8c4541be0101863e2673942885","quote":"On March 24, 2025, the Company completed the acquisition of 100% of the issued and outstanding shares of Topone, an insurance agency company in Hong Kong, at a total consideration of RMB 1,107 in cash.","context":"Acquisition of Topone Consultants Limited","section":"Results of Operations","block":151,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-078731","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-16","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001769256","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769256/0001