nder the 2022 Plan for future grants to eligible participants. As of March 31, 2026, no awards had been granted under the 2022 Plan.","context":"On November 18, 2022, the board of directors has approved and adopted the 2022 share incentive plan (the “2022 Plan”). The maximum number of shares available for issuance under the 2022 Plan is 2,500,000 Class B ordinary shares (after giving effects to share consolidation in January 2025) of the Company.","section":"Segment reporting","block":332,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-078731","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-16","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001769256","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769256/000121390026078731/ea0296080-6k_xchange.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/9846771389d4dc09595cbc77276b3e5be5a9694c952c131163f3e51ecdb6845e.bin","sha256":"9846771389d4dc09595cbc77276b3e5be5a9694c952c131163f3e51ecdb6845e"}},{"id":"ba1681d62b66d943d019fc39efee960f77309f959ce09fe08651eed9a3258b83","quote":"In respect of matters requiring the votes of shareholders, holders of Class A ordinary shares are entitled to one vote per share, while holders of Class B ordinary shares are entitled to ten votes per share based on our dual class share structure. Each Class B ordinary share is convertible into one (1) Class A ordinary share at any time by the holder thereof, while Class A ordinary shares are not convertible into Class B ordinary shares under any circumstances. Upon any transfer of Class B ordinary shares by a holder thereof to any person or entity which is not an affiliate of such holder, such Class B ordinary shares shall be automatically and immediately converted into the equal number of Class A ordinary shares.","context":"The Company designated Golden Stream Ltd., a Cayman Islands company (the “ESOP Platform”), to hold the shares reserved under the 2022 Plan for future grants to eligible participants. As 